{"applicability_conditions":"用于多轴锻造（MAF）过程中评价位错密度变化对屈服强度的贡献；论文未给出更具体的温度/材料范围限制。","identity":{"block_id":"b0047","equation_id":"equation_005","equation_number":"5","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\Delta \\sigma_ {\\rho} = \\alpha M G b (\\rho_ {f} ^ {1 / 2} - \\rho_ {0} ^ {1 / 2})\\tag{5}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.mtcomm.2024.108270"},"latex":"\\Delta \\sigma_{\\rho} = \\alpha M G b (\\rho_{f}^{1/2} - \\rho_{0}^{1/2})","purpose":"采用 Taylor 方程估算位错对屈服强度的贡献（位错强化增量）。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错对屈服强度的贡献（位错强化引起的屈服强度增量）","symbol":"\\Delta \\sigma_{\\rho}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Taylor 常数","symbol":"\\alpha","unit":null,"value":"0.24"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"平均 Taylor 因子","symbol":"M","unit":null,"value":"3.0"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"剪切模量","symbol":"G","unit":"GPa","value":"61 GPa"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Burgers 矢量（论文的 where 从句中未作解释）","symbol":"b","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"MAF 过程中的位错密度","symbol":"\\rho_{f}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"初始位错密度","symbol":"\\rho_{0}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["该式被称为 Taylor 方程（参考文献 [34]）。","α 与 M 的取值参考文献为 [35,38]。","where 从句中未对符号 b（Burgers 矢量）作解释，也未给出其数值。","位错密度项以 1/2 次幂形式出现。"]}